{"1267290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Field of Heroes", "steam_appid": 1267290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten seconds left on the clock. You have the ball. A fire breathing wyvern attacks – but you dodge just in time, thanks to a teammate’s spell. A giant worm appears, ready to crush you under its massive weight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just another day in Field of Heroes …</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/90ca765619122f7b2a2b6d5433378726.poster.avif?t=1787858923\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/90ca765619122f7b2a2b6d5433378726.webm?t=1787858923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/90ca765619122f7b2a2b6d5433378726.mp4?t=1787858923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing inspiration from Pigskin <i>621 A.D.</i>, <i>Rocket League</i>, and <i>Mario Strikers</i>, <i>Field of Heroes</i> is a real-time online spectacle that mixes competitive sports and visceral combat – but with orcs. A LOT of orcs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of nine unique warriors, compete online,  and seek glory with built-in Twitch integration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to step onto the <i>Field of Heroes</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/13a0307a81ea2fba2405dc8a9fb35dc0.poster.avif?t=1787858923\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/13a0307a81ea2fba2405dc8a9fb35dc0.webm?t=1787858923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/13a0307a81ea2fba2405dc8a9fb35dc0.mp4?t=1787858923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose your hero:</i> Play as one of nine unique warriors, each with a unique backstory and skill set.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Compete Anywhere:</i> In online 5v5 PvPvE matches or single player versus AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Play your way:</i> Host your own online matches with custom rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Living battlegrounds<strong>: </strong></i>A variety of fields of play that include engaging monsters and dangerous obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Gain Notoriety:</i> Track your wins with leaderboards and personal stats.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten seconds left on the clock. You have the ball. A fire breathing wyvern attacks – but you dodge just in time, thanks to a teammate’s spell. A giant worm appears, ready to crush you under its massive weight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just another day in Field of Heroes …</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/90ca765619122f7b2a2b6d5433378726.poster.avif?t=1787858923\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/90ca765619122f7b2a2b6d5433378726.webm?t=1787858923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/90ca765619122f7b2a2b6d5433378726.mp4?t=1787858923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing inspiration from Pigskin <i>621 A.D.</i>, <i>Rocket League</i>, and <i>Mario Strikers</i>, <i>Field of Heroes</i> is a real-time online spectacle that mixes competitive sports and visceral combat – but with orcs. A LOT of orcs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of nine unique warriors, compete online,  and seek glory with built-in Twitch integration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to step onto the <i>Field of Heroes</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/13a0307a81ea2fba2405dc8a9fb35dc0.poster.avif?t=1787858923\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/13a0307a81ea2fba2405dc8a9fb35dc0.webm?t=1787858923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1267290/extras/13a0307a81ea2fba2405dc8a9fb35dc0.mp4?t=1787858923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose your hero:</i> Play as one of nine unique warriors, each with a unique backstory and skill set.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Compete Anywhere:</i> In online 5v5 PvPvE matches or single player versus AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Play your way:</i> Host your own online matches with custom rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Living battlegrounds<strong>: </strong></i>A variety of fields of play that include engaging monsters and dangerous obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Gain Notoriety:</i> Track your wins with leaderboards and personal stats.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": 